{"isTeamAdminOrOwner requires both isTeamAdmin and isTeamOwner to be truthy, but isTeamAdmin already covers ADMIN and OWNER memberships and isTeamOwner only matches owners, so this branch now only lets owners add guests; team admins will hit the FORBIDDEN even though the feature should allow admin OR owner - should change the guard to require admin OR owner instead": 0.9003357291221619, "EventManager is constructed with ctx.user credentials, so attendee-initiated adds run with the attendee's calendar tokens (not the organizer's) yet updateCalendarAttendees uses those creds to update external calendars; attendees lack permission to touch the organizer's calendar, so external updates now silently fail when an attendee adds guests - should build the manager with the organizer's credentials instead": 0.844199001789093}